---
export const title = 'Ask';
export const order = 450;
import DemoComponentCard from '../../../../components/DemoComponentCard.astro';
---

<p>
  With <code>ask</code>, the search box is also where people ask the assistant (ADR-030002): the
  <strong>Ask</strong> button and Ctrl+Enter (⌘Enter) fire <code>ask</code>, while Enter still fires
  <code>search</code>. <code>ask-placeholder</code> says both are possible. With AI off for the page,
  it is a plain search box: no button, the usual placeholder.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <wc-search
    id='search-ask'
    ask
    placeholder='Search apps and records'
    ask-placeholder='Ask for something, or search apps and records'
    style='inline-size: 100%; max-inline-size: 36rem;'
  ></wc-search>
  <script is:inline>
    (function () {
      var el = document.querySelector('#search-ask');
      el.addEventListener('ask', function (event) {
        myConsole.log('ask: ' + event.detail.value + ' (open the assistant with it)');
      });
      el.addEventListener('search', function (event) {
        myConsole.log('search: ' + event.detail.value);
      });
    })();
  </script>
</DemoComponentCard>
